WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.500
Protect the Future!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.500
DATS's Final Battle

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.470
Protect the Future!

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.500
DATS's Final Battle!

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.750
You foolish humans.

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:29.860
Could this...

00:00:29.860 --> 00:00:31.610
Could this be...?!

00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.550
This is Yggdrasil's true form!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:41.330
Something's coming!

00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:50.130
ShineGreymon!

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:54.650
Look!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:55.380
The human world!

00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.650
What the hell are you doing?!

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:12.620
I've told you.

00:01:12.620 --> 00:01:14.630
This is divine punishment.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:16.070
Divine... punishment?

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.970
This is the sentence you deserve for challenging God.

00:01:19.970 --> 00:01:20.840
Now...

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.040
atone for your sins with your deaths!

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.580
We won't do as you please!

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:30.750
We'll fight you, even if it means burning out our lives!

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:31.900
Ikuto!

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.570
Give me power!

00:01:33.570 --> 00:01:34.200
Okay!

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:39.510
Digisoul Charge!

00:01:37.640 --> 00:01:39.510
Digisoul Charge!

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:40.730
Overdrive!

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:40.730
Overdrive!

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:42.910
Gaomon, evolve!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:44.280
Lalamon, evolve!

00:01:44.280 --> 00:01:45.760
Falcomon, evolve!

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.780
MirageGaogamon!

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:11.790
Rosemon!

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:21.590
Ravemon!

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.330
Let's go, guys!

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.180
This is our last battle!

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:25.600
Yeah!

00:02:25.180 --> 00:02:25.600
Yeah!

00:02:25.930 --> 00:02:27.050
Fools.

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.260
Double Crescent Mirage!

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:34.760
Glorious Burst!

00:02:38.560 --> 00:02:40.170
Roses Rapier!

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.490
Spiral Raven Claw!

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:49.000
Ravemon!

00:02:49.430 --> 00:02:50.120
There's more!

00:02:58.350 --> 00:02:59.850
Master, your orders!

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.560
If we keep our distance, the crystals attack us.

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:05.220
If we approach him, those vines swoop down on us.

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:05.970
He has no openings!

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:08.430
If he doesn't have any, we'll just have to make them!

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.500
GeoGrey Sword!

00:03:27.060 --> 00:03:27.780
What?!

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:30.200
The GeoGrey Sword got snapped!

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.500
ShineGreymon!

00:03:41.590 --> 00:03:44.510
You are fools to continue opposing me.

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:23.610
ShineGreymon!

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:25.090
Hang in there!

00:04:25.090 --> 00:04:27.070
Hey, you guys!

00:04:28.550 --> 00:04:31.100
Now do you realize the immensity of my power?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:33.460
You bastard...

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:37.190
Stop looking down on us from up there!

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.440
I'm still...

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:41.190
We're still alive!

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:46.070
As long as we're clinging to life, we'll keep striking you until you fall!

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.290
Just try it.

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:56.760
D-Don't!

00:04:56.760 --> 00:05:00.710
If you get hit with that again, everyone will absolutely, positively die!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:05.100
When you're in a man's fight, you're already risking your life!

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:07.880
The moment you get scared of dying...

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:18.150
<i>There will come a time in a man's life when he must accomplish something at the risk of his life.</i>

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:20.040
<i>Now is that time.</i>

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.360
Dad...

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.770
No, this isn't a regular school fight!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.780
It's a battle to protect everyone!

00:05:27.780 --> 00:05:29.240
Right, Dad?!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:31.530
That's right!

00:05:31.530 --> 00:05:32.700
We won't lose!

00:05:33.320 --> 00:05:36.490
We have to win this fight no matter what!

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:37.460
That's why...!

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:41.170
We can't die!

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:42.570
Yeah!

00:05:42.570 --> 00:05:44.280
We'll definitely win!

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:48.930
In that case, I shall get rid of the very reason you are fighting for.

00:05:51.630 --> 00:05:53.350
Wait, you bastard!

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:55.100
Where is he going?

00:05:55.530 --> 00:05:56.990
The human world!

00:05:56.990 --> 00:06:00.560
Yggdrasil is going to destroy the human world himself!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:06.880
This is the worst.

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:08.950
We can't stay here!

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:11.520
Stand up, ShineGreymon!

00:06:11.520 --> 00:06:13.320
We're going after Yggdrasil!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:15.910
Okay!

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:20.080
Please...

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.250
Please don't leave me behind!

00:07:41.280 --> 00:07:42.050
Chika.

00:07:42.050 --> 00:07:43.070
It's dangerous here.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:44.260
Let's get out of here.

00:07:44.260 --> 00:07:45.350
We can't!

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:50.380
Craniummon is holding up the Digital World in my dad's place!

00:07:50.380 --> 00:07:52.590
We can't leave him!

00:07:52.590 --> 00:07:53.510
But...

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:06.780
Here you are, Craniummon.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:10.420
What a foolish and pitiful traitor you are.

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:12.280
Ygg...drasil...

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:17.900
But your life will not be in vain.

00:08:17.900 --> 00:08:21.820
Stand there and watch as I erase the human world.

00:08:37.620 --> 00:08:38.280
Chika!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:00.160
Piyomon!

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:01.830
How could you do that?!

00:09:02.350 --> 00:09:03.710
Can't you tell?

00:09:03.710 --> 00:09:05.180
This is purification!

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:07.680
Look!

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:11.000
Do you know why the worlds are crumbling?

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:14.180
What caused this situation is none other than

00:09:14.180 --> 00:09:17.180
the evil hearts you humans have!

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:23.220
Therefore, I shall reduce everything in this world to ashes.

00:09:23.220 --> 00:09:25.770
To save the Digital World!

00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:27.130
No...

00:09:27.130 --> 00:09:27.940
No way...

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:30.690
Now, you too shall disappear!

00:09:32.560 --> 00:09:33.590
NO!

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.150
Chika...

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.240
ShineGreymon!

00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:42.810
{onkei: Are? How does he know the name?}{Splash: HE'S FAMOUS... saa.}

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:44.040
Are you okay, Chika?

00:09:44.340 --> 00:09:45.410
Masaru-niichan!

00:09:50.830 --> 00:09:51.630
Everyone else is here, too!

00:09:54.340 --> 00:09:56.490
I won't let you hurt anyone else!

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.780
We will protect this world!

00:09:59.780 --> 00:10:01.180
Yggdrasil!

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:03.810
We won't let you do as you please anymore!

00:10:04.420 --> 00:10:06.640
We'll never lose!

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:07.770
We will fight!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:11.900
Charge!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:11.900
Charge!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:17.130
Digisoul Burst!

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:17.130
Digisoul Burst!

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:34.250
ShineGreymon!

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.750
Burst Mode!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.710
MirageGaogamon!

00:10:51.710 --> 00:10:52.860
Burst Mode!

00:10:58.490 --> 00:10:59.760
Rosemon!

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:01.140
Burst Mode!

00:11:04.400 --> 00:11:05.320
Ravemon!

00:11:07.290 --> 00:11:08.850
Burst Mode!

00:11:10.910 --> 00:11:13.150
Final Shining Burst!

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:16.120
Full Moon Meteor Impact!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:17.870
Tiferet!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.920
Raikou-issen-no-tsuki!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:20.920
Lightning Flash Thrust

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:29.460
Take that!

00:11:36.030 --> 00:11:37.070
ShineGreymon!

00:11:41.210 --> 00:11:44.070
The degree of your power was impressive.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:48.540
But even that is impotent against a God!

00:11:48.820 --> 00:11:50.200
He can self-regenerate?!

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.140
Certainly.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:54.590
Death does not exist for a God.

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:59.270
Not only do I have everlasting life, but I can be resurrected at any time.

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:06.340
ShineGreymon!

00:12:22.730 --> 00:12:24.350
ShineGreymon!

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:26.460
Disappear along with this world!

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:46.800
Wh-What's that?

00:12:54.590 --> 00:12:55.980
Brother...

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:07.360
Are you all right... Gaomon?

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:09.800
Lalamon...

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:10.830
Open your eyes...

00:13:12.330 --> 00:13:12.990
Falcomon...

00:13:14.130 --> 00:13:16.000
Hang in there, Agumon!

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:19.040
Agumon...

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.020
You bastard...

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:24.260
You hurt my follower!

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:25.880
I won't forgive you!

00:13:25.880 --> 00:13:29.030
I'm bringing you down!

00:13:29.030 --> 00:13:30.120
Anger...

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.260
Hatred...

00:13:32.090 --> 00:13:36.980
Don't forget that countless Digimon harbor those same feelings.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:37.940
What?

00:13:39.100 --> 00:13:43.200
The humans have snatched away the lives of many innocent Digimon.

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:49.940
The hatred and sorrow they feel from losing their companions is endlessly deep.

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:55.010
My judgment is the will of the Digimon.

00:13:55.430 --> 00:13:57.720
That's not true...

00:13:57.720 --> 00:14:01.790
There are Digimon... who understand the humans...

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.360
Just like us...

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.300
There are those who will fight with us!

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.800
Where are they then?

00:14:09.250 --> 00:14:14.470
Where are these Digimon who will disobey their God and aid the humans?!

00:14:18.360 --> 00:14:20.810
This is... as much as I can take...

00:14:21.280 --> 00:14:23.310
It's still too early to give up!

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:25.230
Daimon Masaru...

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.170
Just as you say,

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:29.940
it might only be Agumon and the others who support us now.

00:14:29.940 --> 00:14:30.900
But...

00:14:30.900 --> 00:14:32.950
We'll create it with our own hands!

00:14:32.950 --> 00:14:35.990
We'll create a world where humans and Digimon can live together!

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:38.450
Your Digisoul...

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:39.910
Masaru...

00:14:40.460 --> 00:14:41.610
That's why...

00:14:41.610 --> 00:14:43.580
I can't let either of them be destroyed!

00:14:43.580 --> 00:14:44.870
The human world...

00:14:44.870 --> 00:14:46.320
and the Digital World...

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:49.610
I'll show you I can protect both of them!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.290
It's useless.

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:59.390
The power of one person alone can't save the world.

00:15:00.170 --> 00:15:01.850
Masaru is not alone!

00:15:02.430 --> 00:15:04.150
He has us!

00:15:11.580 --> 00:15:13.030
What's wrong, Kamemon?

00:15:14.640 --> 00:15:15.520
Wait!

00:15:15.520 --> 00:15:17.490
Where are you going, Kamemon?

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.490
Megumi, are you okay?

00:15:26.490 --> 00:15:27.510
Somewhat...

00:15:28.810 --> 00:15:29.670
PawnChessmon!

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.510
Where are you going?

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.150
Wait!

00:15:33.150 --> 00:15:34.380
PawnChessmon!

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:39.110
Wait!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.430
Everyone!

00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.980
It's dangerous out there!

00:15:44.210 --> 00:15:45.270
Everyone...

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.100
Gotsumon?

00:15:50.100 --> 00:15:51.340
I feel like...

00:15:51.340 --> 00:15:53.320
I feel like someone is calling for me.

00:15:54.240 --> 00:15:55.270
Me, too.

00:15:55.270 --> 00:15:55.780
Piyomon?

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:00.700
What?!

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:04.120
You're trying to force back the Digital World?

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.180
Those lights!

00:16:14.610 --> 00:16:15.820
I see!

00:16:15.820 --> 00:16:19.490
The Digimon are easily affected by human emotions,

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:22.510
and among our emotions, the strongest is...

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:23.890
our attachment to life!

00:16:24.340 --> 00:16:29.360
And we've constantly kept that emotion with us since ancient times.

00:16:30.120 --> 00:16:34.070
The power of that emotion is pure and unbeatable!

00:16:34.350 --> 00:16:38.240
So the Digimon are answering to our will to live?

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.750
I can feel them...

00:16:40.750 --> 00:16:42.920
The power of the Digimon!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:46.200
The feelings to protect both worlds!

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:51.960
We stopped the Digital World from falling!

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.170
This is... the power of human emotions?

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:57.440
Emotions?

00:16:57.440 --> 00:17:03.380
Those human desires of yours are what first caused the Digimon to run wild!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:09.630
Those are...

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.770
The Royal Knights!

00:17:17.530 --> 00:17:19.020
Royal Knights!

00:17:19.020 --> 00:17:21.200
Kill these fools!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:25.200
What are you doing? Do it now!

00:17:25.750 --> 00:17:28.030
I'd like to ask one thing of you, Yggdrasil.

00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.380
What is a god?

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:30.330
What?

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:35.690
Our comrades are desperately trying to save the two worlds right now.

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:38.800
And yet, you are willing to abandon them?

00:17:39.110 --> 00:17:41.760
You must not question a God's orders!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.060
I shall never excuse you if you disobey me!

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:46.620
That's wrong!

00:17:50.020 --> 00:17:51.360
Dukemon!

00:17:51.360 --> 00:17:52.400
You're alive!

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:55.380
Sleipmon taught me the truth.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:57.310
God is not absolute!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.910
Even a god may make mistakes.

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:01.620
Sleipmon did?

00:18:02.020 --> 00:18:03.980
Yes.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:09.390
He burned up all of the Digisoul he still had within his body,

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:13.450
and saved me from the dark depths of the ocean.

00:18:16.190 --> 00:18:17.600
Sleipmon!

00:18:19.190 --> 00:18:19.970
No way!

00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:21.260
Then,

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:22.560
where's Sleipmon?!

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:23.930
Is Kudamon dead?!

00:18:24.410 --> 00:18:26.100
Don't be stupid!

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:27.560
Kudamon!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:32.750
Both humans and Digimon share the desire to live.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:34.580
Yggdrasil.

00:18:34.580 --> 00:18:38.740
If you call yourself a god, then grant us our wish!

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:42.700
So even you are going against me...

00:18:47.350 --> 00:18:48.610
Very well.

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:51.100
Die along with the humans!

00:18:55.730 --> 00:18:56.840
Omegamon!

00:18:59.620 --> 00:19:00.730
Yggdrasil!

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:01.510
Have you lost your mind?!

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:05.090
It is all of <i>you</i>  who have lost your minds!

00:19:05.090 --> 00:19:06.300
I...

00:19:06.300 --> 00:19:09.480
am the God of the Digital World!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:11.000
W-What's that?!

00:19:12.710 --> 00:19:15.520
My name is Yggdrasil.

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:22.400
I am the WIZ9000 computer model built to observe the evolution of Digimon.

00:19:23.400 --> 00:19:25.290
What the hell is he talking about?

00:19:25.290 --> 00:19:30.910
My experiments on evolution have resulted in failure due to the human's intervention.

00:19:30.910 --> 00:19:38.380
The program acting on Error Code 401 will be initiated, and all systems will be switched over to a new world.

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.050
A new world?

00:19:50.140 --> 00:19:51.270
The Digimon!

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:52.860
Stop!

00:19:55.810 --> 00:19:56.650
Dukemon!

00:20:05.880 --> 00:20:06.670
Oh no!

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:08.390
He can't keep holding it up at this rate!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:13.410
The Royal Knights are...!

00:20:21.560 --> 00:20:30.170
The probability of preventing the human world and Digital World from colliding is 0.00001%.

00:20:30.170 --> 00:20:31.720
Unable to compute.

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.470
This isn't based on numbers!

00:20:33.470 --> 00:20:35.190
This is about our feelings!

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:38.280
Humans and Digimon both want to live...

00:20:38.280 --> 00:20:39.690
That is <i>everyone's</i>  wish!

00:20:40.100 --> 00:20:41.230
Unable to compute.

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:43.030
Unable to compute.

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:47.570
All who interrupt the program's execution will be eliminated.

00:20:52.260 --> 00:20:53.630
You bastard...

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:57.870
Just because things didn't go your way, you're willing to let them die?

00:20:57.870 --> 00:21:00.640
All of those lives who spread their roots as they persevered...

00:21:00.640 --> 00:21:01.810
All of your comrades...

00:21:01.810 --> 00:21:04.470
Is that all you thought about them?!

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:09.680
For someone who never considered the weight of life beyond that,

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.230
you're not qualified to call yourself a god!

00:21:13.390 --> 00:21:14.310
Masaru!

00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:15.850
Masaru-niichan!

00:21:16.240 --> 00:21:16.810
Masaru!

00:21:17.150 --> 00:21:17.770
Masaru!

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:20.250
Aniki...

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:21.730
I won't lose either...

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.470
